// A route into a composite's second rank, through a port on the border its
// ranks start at. Coordinate assignment set the port below `First`, the way it
// sets a bend, and `Target`'s face ended above it, so the route crossed the
// border and jogged up to reach `Target`, as `mill`'s `tool change` did into
// `tool/arm/Ready`.
chart level "a route through a rank border, level with the state it joins" {
  state Source,
  state Box { state First, state Target, trans * -> First, trans First -> Target },

  trans * -> Source,
  trans Source -> Box/Target "reach",
}
